  <model metaid="meta_apixaban_kidney" id="apixaban_kidney" name="Model for renal apixaban excretion." substanceUnits="mmole" timeUnits="min" volumeUnits="litre" areaUnits="m2" lengthUnits="metre" extentUnits="mmole">
    <notes>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Model for the renal excretion of apixaban and its metabolites M1 and M7.</p>
        <p>The renal clearances are given relative to the glomerular filtration rate
(GFR), which scales with the renal function; the GFR does not depend on the
body weight (Upreti2013: the renal clearance was similar across the groups
of body weight).</p>
        <p>The content of this model has been carefully created in a manual research effort.</p>
